{"timestamp": 1779345059.442314, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I found Diana's body in Medbay. I had just come up from Storage, and when I walked in, Bob was standing right there next to her. Bob, you have some explaining to do \u2014 did you see who did it, or was it you? Everyone else, where were you?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779345068.286714, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I was on the complete opposite side of the ship from Medbay. I started in Security and then moved down to Navigation to work on my tasks, so I was nowhere near the body. I actually haven't run into anyone on my side of the map yet. \n\nSince Frank found the body and says Bob was standing right there, we definitely need to hear Bob's side of the story. Let's see if Bob has an explanation or if he tries to pin it back on Frank before we jump to any conclusions."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345075.9679956, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I headed straight from the Cafeteria over to Weapons to do my tasks. I haven't run into a single soul this whole round, so I can't really vouch for anyone or confirm any alibis on that side of the map. \n\nFrank, that's a pretty heavy accusation against Bob. We definitely need to hear Bob's defense right now. Bob, were you really standing over Diana's body, or is Frank making this up to cover his own tracks? Let's hear it."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345086.0646281, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Whoa, wait a second. Frank, are you seriously trying to pin this on me? I just walked into Medbay from Upper Engine and saw YOU kill Diana right in front of me! You literally sliced her and instantly self-reported before I could even hit the report button myself. \n\nYou're trying to beat me to the punch because you know I caught you red-handed. It's a classic self-report. Alice, Eve, neither of you were around, but I'm telling you, Frank is lying through his teeth to cover his tracks. It's Frank, 100%. If you vote me out and see I'm a Goose, you'll know exactly who to vote next, but we need to get Frank out right now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345098.373403, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I haven't seen anyone all round either. I went from Weapons down to Security and then over to Electrical, so I was nowhere near Medbay to witness any of this. \n\nThis is a classic 1v1 between Frank and Bob. One of them is definitely the Duck. Since Frank reported the body and made the accusation first, Bob's defense sounds a bit like a panic reaction. Either way, we have to pick one of them. Let's vote Bob today. If the game doesn't end and he turns out to be a Goose, we all know 100% that we need to immediately hit the button and vote out Frank next round. We have the numbers to take this 50/50. I'm voting Bob."}}
